<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Job Work Order — {{docNo}}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/base.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="sheet">

  {{> mast company=company docTitle="Job Work Order" docNo=docNo docPill=docPill}}

  <!-- 01 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>01 &mdash; Order &amp; Job Worker</span><b>{{processBanner}}</b></div>
    <div class="kv">
      <div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Job Worker</span><span class="v">{{jobWorkerName}}</span></div>
        {{#if jobWorkerAddress}}<div class="row"><span class="k">Address</span><span class="v">{{jobWorkerAddress}}</span></div>{{/if}}
        <div class="row"><span class="k">GSTIN</span><span class="v">{{#if jobWorkerGstin}}{{jobWorkerGstin}} &middot; <span class="muted">Registered</span>{{else}}<span class="muted">Unregistered</span>{{/if}}</span></div>
        {{#if jobWorkerContact}}<div class="row"><span class="k">Contact</span><span class="v">{{jobWorkerContact}}</span></div>{{/if}}
        {{#if buyerRef}}<div class="row"><span class="k">Buyer Ref</span><span class="v">{{buyerRef}}</span></div>{{/if}}
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Order Date</span><span class="v">{{orderDate}}{{#if approvedByName}} &middot; <span class="muted">appr. {{approvedByName}}</span>{{/if}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Challan No.</span><span class="v">{{challanRef}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Due Back</span><span class="v">{{dueBack}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Statutory Due</span><span class="v">{{statutoryDue}} <span class="muted">&mdash; Sec 143, 1 yr</span></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 02 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>02 &mdash; Material Issued &middot; Ownership retained by {{company.name}}</span><b>No tax &mdash; not a supply</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:34px">#</th><th>Item / Lot</th><th style="width:56px">UOM</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:70px">Qty</th><th class="num" style="width:70px">Rate</th><th class="num" style="width:88px">Value ₹</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if materialRows.length}}
        {{#each materialRows}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.item}}{{#if this.subline}}<br><span class="muted">{{this.subline}}</span>{{/if}}</td><td>{{this.uom}}</td><td class="num">{{this.qty}}</td><td class="num">{{this.rate}}</td><td class="num">{{this.value}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{else}}
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        {{/if}}
        <tr class="tot"><td colspan="5">Total material value issued &mdash; for delivery challan / e-way bill only</td><td class="num">{{materialTotal}}</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- 03 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>03 &mdash; Expected Output, Job Charges &amp; Tax</span><b>Conversion only</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Output Item</th><th style="width:74px">Spec</th><th class="num" style="width:64px">Exp. Qty</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:54px">Tol.</th><th class="num" style="width:70px">{{rateColLabel}}</th><th class="num" style="width:88px">Amount ₹</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each chargeRows}}
        <tr><td>{{this.item}}{{#if this.subline}}<br><span class="muted">{{this.subline}}</span>{{/if}}</td><td>{{this.spec}}</td><td class="num">{{this.expQty}}</td><td class="num">{{this.tolerance}}</td><td class="num">{{this.rate}}</td><td class="num">{{this.amount}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        <tr class="sub"><td colspan="5">Taxable value of job work service &middot; SAC {{sacCode}}</td><td class="num">{{taxableValue}}</td></tr>
        {{#if isResolved}}
        {{#if isInterstate}}
        <tr><td colspan="5">IGST @ {{gstRatePct}} <span class="muted">&mdash; inter-state</span></td><td class="num">{{igst}}</td></tr>
        {{else}}
        <tr><td colspan="5">CGST @ {{halfGstRatePct}}</td><td class="num">{{cgst}}</td></tr>
        <tr><td colspan="5">SGST @ {{halfGstRatePct}} <span class="muted">&mdash; intra-state, both parties State {{company.stateCode}}</span></td><td class="num">{{sgst}}</td></tr>
        {{/if}}
        <tr class="tot"><td colspan="5">Gross commitment to job worker <span class="muted">(GST recoverable as ITC &mdash; not product cost)</span></td><td class="num">{{gross}}</td></tr>
        {{else}}
        <tr class="tot"><td colspan="5">GST &mdash; rate not resolved, see below</td><td class="num">&mdash;</td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    {{#unless isResolved}}
    <div class="blocked">
      <b>GST rate unresolved &mdash; do not treat this figure as final</b>
      No GST rate is configured for <strong>{{processName}}</strong>. Dyeing and printing of textiles were removed from the 5% job-work entry by Notification 15/2021-CT(R) and taxed at 12%.
      That slab was abolished on 22 Sep 2025. Whether the carve-out survives &mdash; making this 18% &mdash; or was folded back into the
      5% textile entry has not been confirmed against the consolidated notification text.
      Confirm with the firm&rsquo;s CA, then set <code>ProcessType.gstRate</code> for {{processCode}} once.
    </div>
    {{/unless}}

    {{#if showCostingCallout}}
    <div class="callout">
      {{#if isResolved}}
      <b>Costing basis &mdash; tax-exclusive</b>
      FG value = material ₹{{fgMaterial}} + job charges ₹{{fgCharges}} = <strong>₹{{fgValue}}</strong>.
      At {{expQtyStr}} {{uomShort}} expected this is <strong>₹{{fgRate}} {{fgRateUnit}}</strong>. Loss within {{toleranceStr}} tolerance is absorbed into this rate.
      GST of ₹{{gstExcluded}} is <strong>excluded</strong> &mdash; it is input credit, not inventory cost.
      Shortfall beyond tolerance is recovered by debit note at issued rate and must not be loaded onto FG.
      {{else}}
      <b>Costing basis is unaffected</b>
      FG value = ₹{{fgMaterial}} + ₹{{fgCharges}} = <strong>₹{{fgValue}}</strong> &rarr; <strong>₹{{fgRate}} {{fgRateUnit}}</strong> at {{expQtyStr}} {{uomShort}}.
      This is tax-exclusive either way, so the open rate question does not change inventory valuation &mdash;
      only the cash payable and the credit recoverable.
      {{/if}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- 04 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>04 &mdash; Return Reconciliation</span><b>Completed at gate inward</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Particulars</th><th class="num" style="width:80px">Qty ({{uomHead}})</th><th class="num" style="width:64px">%</th><th style="width:200px">Remarks / Action</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Issued</td><td class="num">{{issuedQty}}</td><td class="num">100.0</td><td class="muted">{{issuedRemark}}</td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td>Received &mdash; A grade</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td>Received &mdash; B grade / seconds</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td>Normal loss (within {{toleranceStr}})</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td>Abnormal loss / damage</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td>Balance still with job worker</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- 05 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>05 &mdash; Terms</span><b>Sec. 143 CGST &middot; Rule 55</b></div>
    <ol class="terms">
      <li>Goods are issued for job work only. Title remains with {{company.name}} at all times; the job worker holds them as bailee and shall not create any lien or encumbrance.</li>
      <li>Material must be returned within <strong>one year</strong> of despatch. Beyond this the despatch is deemed a supply from the original despatch date, with interest &mdash; recoverable from the job worker.</li>
      <li>Movement is against delivery challan under Rule 55 (triplicate). Return under the job worker&rsquo;s own challan quoting this order number.</li>
      <li>The job worker&rsquo;s invoice shall cover <strong>conversion charges only</strong>, at SAC {{sacCode}}. Any material sold by the job worker to us requires a separate purchase order and separate invoice.</li>
      <li>Wastage beyond the stated tolerance of {{toleranceStr}} is to the job worker&rsquo;s account and will be debited at issued material rate.</li>
      <li>Output must match the approved sample and spec. Rejections return freight-to-pay; no conversion charge is payable on rejected quantity.</li>
      <li>Payment within 30 days of receipt of goods and a correct invoice, after the reconciliation above is signed off.</li>
      <li>Quantities will be reported in ITC-04 for the relevant period. Job worker to acknowledge receipt on the duplicate challan copy.</li>
      <li>Sub-contracting to a third party without prior written consent is not permitted.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="sign">
    <div>Prepared by / Store</div>
    <div>Authorised Signatory &mdash; {{company.name}}</div>
    <div>Job Worker &mdash; Received goods &amp; accepted terms</div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    <span>{{docNo}} &middot; Page 1 of 1</span>
    <span>Copy: Job Worker &middot; Store &middot; Accounts</span>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
